---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Mar Azul's Annual Christmas Celebration: 5 Years of Giving Back to Nosara's Children | Coyol Real Estate">
  <article class="blog-post">
    <header class="post-header">
      <p class="category">Community</p>
      <h1>Mar Azul's Annual Christmas Celebration: 5 Years of Giving Back</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Each December, over 200 local children gather for a day of joy, gifts, and community spirit</p>
      <time datetime="2026-08-01">August 1, 2026</time>
    </header>

    <figure class="hero-image">
      <img src="/images/mar-azul/christmas-event.jpg" alt="Children at Mar Azul Christmas celebration" />
      <figcaption>Local children enjoying the annual Mar Azul Christmas celebration</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="post-content">
      <p class="lead">For five consecutive years, the developers of Mar Azul have hosted an annual Christmas event that has become a beloved tradition for families throughout the Nosara community. Each December, over 200 Costa Rican children gather to celebrate the holiday season with gifts, food, music, and the magic of community.</p>

      <h2>A Tradition Born from Gratitude</h2>
      
      <p>When the Mar Azul development began taking shape in the hills above Nosara, the team behind the project recognized that their success was intertwined with the community that welcomed them. The annual Christmas celebration was created as a way to give back — not as a one-time gesture, but as an ongoing commitment.</p>
      
      <p>"Nosara gave us an opportunity to build something special," explains the development team. "The least we can do is share that good fortune with the children who will inherit this beautiful place."</p>

      <h2>Five Years of Joy</h2>
      
      <div class="stats-block">
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="number">5</span>
          <span class="label">Consecutive years</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="number">200+</span>
          <span class="label">Children each year</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="number">1,000+</span>
          <span class="label">Total children served</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>What started as a modest gathering has grown into one of Nosara's most anticipated annual events. Each year, the celebration includes:</p>
      
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Individual gifts</strong> for every child in attendance</li>
        <li><strong>Traditional Costa Rican holiday food</strong> prepared by local cooks</li>
        <li><strong>Live music and entertainment</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Games and activities</strong> for children of all ages</li>
        <li><strong>A visit from Santa Claus</strong> (Colacho, as he's known in Costa Rica)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>More Than a Party</h2>
      
      <p>For many families in the Nosara area, the holiday season can be financially challenging. The Mar Azul Christmas event ensures that every child — regardless of their family's circumstances — experiences the joy of the season.</p>
      
      <blockquote>
        "When you see 200 children laughing, playing, and opening gifts, you understand what community really means. This isn't charity — it's family. These are our neighbors, and their children are the future of Nosara."
      </blockquote>

      <h2>Community Partners</h2>
      
      <p>The event's success depends on collaboration with local organizations, schools, and volunteers who help identify families, coordinate logistics, and ensure every child is included. Local businesses contribute food, supplies, and entertainment, making it a true community effort.</p>

      <h2>Looking Forward</h2>
      
      <p>As Mar Azul continues to grow, so does the commitment to this annual tradition. Plans for future celebrations include expanding the event's reach to include more children from surrounding communities and adding educational components like book drives and school supply donations.</p>
      
      <p>The Christmas celebration represents just one part of Mar Azul's broader commitment to being a positive force in Nosara — from donating water infrastructure to ASADA Santa Marta to supporting local employment and sustainable development practices.</p>

      <h2>About Mar Azul</h2>
      
      <p>Mar Azul is a private residential community in Nosara, Costa Rica, built on the principle that development and community can thrive together. Located in the Nicoya Peninsula Blue Zone, Mar Azul combines luxury living with environmental stewardship and genuine community engagement.</p>
      
      <p><a href="/developments/mar-azul">Learn more about Mar Azul →</a></p>
    </div>

    <footer class="post-footer">
      <div class="tags">
        <span>Tags:</span>
        <a href="/blog/tag/community">Community</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/events">Events</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/mar-azul">Mar Azul</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/nosara">Nosara</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/giving-back">Giving Back</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .blog-post {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .post-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .category {
    color: #3D4F3D;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    color: #1A1F16;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  time {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .hero-image {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .hero-image figcaption {
    text-align: center;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .post-content {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #333;
  }

  .post-content h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: #1A1F16;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .post-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .post-content ul {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .post-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #444;
    border-left: 4px solid #3D4F3D;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .stats-block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    background: #F5F3EF;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat .number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #3D4F3D;
  }

  .stat .label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #666;
  }

  blockquote {
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #3D4F3D;
    border-left: 4px solid #C4A67C;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .post-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
  }

  .tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .tags span {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .tags a {
    background: #F5F3EF;
    color: #3D4F3D;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .tags a:hover {
    background: #3D4F3D;
    color: white;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .stats-block {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
